# The source/build files THIS STEP OWNS, one per line, relative to the tree
# root.  Generated mechanically from the step's own reference patch -- the
# `+++ b/<path>` target of every hunk in solution/oracle.patch -- so it cannot
# drift from what the step's oracle actually implements.
#
# The capability-envelope gate (tests/check_isa.sh) reads this list to decide
# whether the candidate touched anything this step owns.  A tree that changed
# none of these passes the scoped envelope check vacuously, and the verifier
# says so in as many words; a tree that changed any of them is inspected on its
# own added lines exactly as before.
cpp/src/arrow/CMakeLists.txt
cpp/src/arrow/meson.build
cpp/src/arrow/util/bpacking.cc
cpp/src/arrow/util/bpacking_benchmark.cc
cpp/src/arrow/util/bpacking_simd_128.cc
cpp/src/arrow/util/bpacking_simd_256.cc
cpp/src/arrow/util/bpacking_simd_kernel_internal.h
cpp/src/arrow/util/bpacking_test.cc
